<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine industry output shrinks by 4.5 pct in H1.</title>
<headline>Ukraine industry output shrinks by 4.5 pct in H1.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial output in Ukraine fell by 4.5 percent in the first half of 1997 compared to a decline of 3.1 percent in the same 1996 period, the economy ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>It also said that output fell by 4.9 percent between January and May and by 5.1 percent over the whole of last year.</p>
<p>					JAN-JUN '97	  JAN-JUN '96</p>
<p> UKRAINE INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    -4.5 pct	     -3.1 pct</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +38 044 244 9155</p>
